  intros fx' R' M' model' LK' Aw' x' g' cr' RP KS' _ KO' SZ' OWN HP CK MRT IL IA AM' HH'.
  exact (KONT fx' R' M' model' LK' Aw' x' g' cr' RP KS' KO' SZ' OWN HP CK MRT IL IA AM' HH').
